  "notes": "Official 2025-2026 Sociology (AA-T) Online transfer pathway to CSUB, Cal-GETC pattern. Per-semester printed totals 16 / 13-14 / 16 / 15; row sums reconcile exactly (16+13+16+15=60). Alternate pathway documents exist for the same degree (SOCI-Human-Services variant; also a Racial-Ethnic-Dynamic variant per the transfer center); this ONL variant is seeded as representative. SOSC C271 is cross-listed as PSYC C271 — students can take either for this major, though prerequisites differ for SOCI C271 and PSYC C271. Only semesters 1-4 (the Cerro Coso degree portion) are sequenced; semesters 5-8 are CSUB upper-division coursework and are excluded. Credit ranges use the source's lower bound (documented). No course-level prerequisites are printed on the pathway.",
